==Central Franconian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|gmw-cfr|ald}} {{qualifier|alternative spelling}}
* {{l|gmw-cfr|att}} {{qualifier|common variant; often both forms alongside in the same dialect}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|gmw-cfr|all||all}} with a fossiled neuter ending ''-t.'' Compare {{cog|nl|al}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/alt/|lang=gmw-cfr}}
* {{homophone|alt|lang=gmw-cfr}}

===Adverb===
{{head|gmw-cfr|adverb}}

# {{lb|gmw-cfr|Ripuarian|northern|_|Moselle Franconian}} [[already]]
#: ''Ich hann '''allt''' drissig Minutte op dich jewaat!''
#:: I’ve '''already''' waited for you for thirty minutes!

